'''Value Meal Cat''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the stage [[Catburger Awakens!]] It was added in [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Value Meal Cat
|image = E 357.png
|appearance = [[Catburger Awakens!]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
This cat-like consumable is not very strong, with its stats paling in comparison to your typical Awakened Cat. It can be taken out relatively easily with units like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]].

==Strategy==
Value Meal Cat isn't much of a threat and can be taken out with ease. New players might have a bit of trouble with this delicious enemy, but late-game players will be able to breeze right through this pushover and acquire the [[True Form]] of [[Catburger (Special Cat)|Catburger]].

